  (* Delta Baryons.  The unphysical R[5] carries an isospinor index (IsoSpin)
     and an isovector index (IsoVector); the embedding below satisfies the
     spin-3/2 isospin constraint tau_i Delta_i = 0 and is canonically
     normalised (sum of |coefficient|^2 = 1 for every charge state). *)
  R[1] == {
